Signals):** Filing 20033725 shows simultaneous large-scale partial selling ($3M midpoint) and option buying in both Alphabet and Amazon. Conflicting insider signals make directional conviction unclear.    - **DIS & PYPL (Divestments):** Walt Disney and PayPal holdings are being liquidated ($3M and $375k midpoints, respectively), signaling weak fundamental confidence or capital reallocation by the filer.    - **High-Beta / Concentrated Bets (NVDA, VST, TEM):** Replicating high-volatility tech and energy names at estimated midpoints without real-time order book transparency exposes the portfolio to sharp drawdowns and liquidity risks.  RESULT: Made the bear case against copying the visible book, detailing future-dated filing violations, information latency, wide valuation ranges, and conflicting insider signals across large-scale buys and sells. No orders submitted.' trace=/Users/robertgrzesik/Library/Caches/lumibot/1.0/agent_runtime/traces/bear/af0556c00136da7417ac0ca923bcd0da712f9469a10c5b2fd3b1ff5da4bcd099-20260923034625131162.json
